== Effects ==
* Isaac becomes an invincible statue with 4× [[fire rate]] for 10 seconds. The statue can no longer move normally, and will only be nudged slightly when pressing a movement key. However, it is still affected by knockback.

== Notes ==
* Unlike most effects that grant [[invulnerability]], '''VII - The Chariot?''' does not negate damage from {{m|Blood Donation Machine}}s and {{m|Devil Beggar}}s.

== Synergies ==
* {{i|Rock Bottom}}: The fire rate bonus is retained after the card's effect runs out.

== Interactions ==
* {{I|Tarot Cloth}}: No effect.

